    <string name="settings_detailed_title">aiŋisianakin naepolot</string>
    <string name="settings_detailed_body">ekicoloŋi isukulen luka ewaya kosi apak naka aiperar. android elimokini iboro luka ewaya bon app na etiyakini, kotoma eyauni lo aitodolikinet naemamei aŋer. bluetooth eŋisianakinete bon.</string>
    <string name="settings_detailed_unavailable">mam ejai kanu inyakinio aitodol naka bluetooth: ebuild lo elimokini bon connectedDevice, na erubunio android 14+ kosi apuwan naka bluetooth.</string>
    <string name="settings_playback_only_title">parasia bon aiperar</string>
    <string name="settings_playback_only_body">aparasia eparasiai apak na eperarit eŋer alosit kotoma apak naka arubun. apakio bon nuigirakinitos kosi aiŋisianakin naepolot naitodolikinit epimakis aiperar; luce etodolikinete.</string>
