    <string name="settings_battery_body">ne icodete apakio agirakinio, koŋol ebe itodolit ylih kanuka aitiyaun naka ebateri — app na icodikinit kosi agogoŋ mam eyauni kosodi aitodolikinet naka arubun ne mam eŋaleitai.</string>
    <string name="settings_battery_button">aisisianakin naka ebateri</string>
    <string name="settings_battery_path">aisisianakin → app → ylih → ebateri → mam ekicodikinit.</string>
    <string name="settings_hibernation_body">ne mam eŋaleitai ylih kotoma ilapio luce, ecodikini android kosi eyauni apuwan keŋ, kosi mam igirakinit ibore aŋai ne eŋalei jo. aitodoli ŋun ŋesi na ecamit apesur atiaki aparasia kotoma apak kere na mam imisiiri jo naka app.</string>
    <string name="settings_hibernation_on">epedori android acodikin ylih.</string>
    <string name="settings_hibernation_off">itodolit ylih kosi etiaki agirakin.</string>
    <string name="settings_hibernation_button">aisisianakin naka app lu mam etiyakinete</string>
